class system (including science stream classes) in KVs \nand JNVs is a continuous process which depends upon various factors such as \nopening of new schools, addition of higher classes, availability of funds, availability of \nInternet connectivity etc. and as such no specific time frame can be given in this \nregard.  \n***** \n  \n\nANNEXURE-I \nANNEXURE REFERRED TO IN REPLY TO PARTS (a) & (b) OF THE LOK SABHA \nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO. 17 RAISED BY SHRI DIPSINH SHANKARSINH \nRATHOD & SHRI MOHANBHAI KALYANJI KUNDARIYA, HON’BLE MEMBERS OF \nPARLIAMENT ANSWERED ON 04/12/2023 REGARDING ESTABLISHMENT OF \nSMART CLASSROOMS IN KVs AND JNVs IN GUJARAT. \n \nDISTRICT-WISE DETAILS OF SMART CLASSROOMS  \n(E-CLASSROOMS) IN KVs OF GUJARAT \n  \nSl. \nNo. \nName of Districts  Number of E-classrooms in KVs \n1 Ahmedabad 95 \n2 Anand 11 \n3 Banaskantha 8 \n4 Bharuch 18 \n5 Bhavnagar 3 \n6 Dahod  9 \n7 Devbhumi Dwarka 14 \n8 Gandhinagar 45 \n9 Jamnagar 56 \n10 Junagadh 8 \n11 Kachchh  49 \n12 Mehsana 17 \n13 Panchmahal 8 \n14 Porbandar 10 \n15 Rajkot 15 \n16 Sabarkantha 11 \n17 Surat 25 \n18 Surendranagar 11 \n19 Vadodara 53 \nGrand Total 466 \n***** \n  \n\nANNEXURE-II \nANNEXURE REFERRED TO IN REPLY TO PARTS (a) & (b) OF THE LOK SABHA \nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO. 17 RAISED BY SHRI DIPSINH SHANKARSINH \nRATHOD & SHRI MOHANBHAI KALYANJI KUNDARIYA, HON’BLE MEMBERS OF \nPARLIAMENT ANSWERED ON 04/12/2023 REGARDING ESTABLISHMENT OF \nSMART CLASSROOMS IN KVs AND JNVs IN GUJARAT.  \n \nDISTRICT-WISE DETAILS OF SMART CLASSROOMS  \n(E-CLASSROOMS) IN JNVs OF GUJARAT \n  \nSl. \nNo. Name of Districts  Number of E-classrooms in JNVs \n1 Ahmedabad 2 \n2 Amreli 2 \n3 Anand 2 \n4 Arvalli 2 \n5 Banaskantha 2 \n6 Bharuch 2 \n7 Bhavnagar 2 \n8 Botad 2 \n9 Chhota Udepur 2 \n10 Dahod  13 \n11 Dang 2 \n12 Devbhumi Dwarka 2 \n13 Gandhinagar 2 \n14 Gir Somnath 2 \n15 Jamnagar 2 \n16 Junagadh 2 \n17 Kachchh  13 \n18 Kheda 2 \n19 Mehsana 2 \n20 Mahisagar 2 \n21 Morbi 2 \n22 Narmada 2 \n23 Navsari 2 \n24 Panc