of Rs.  \n75000 Cror e including Rs. 15000 crore from private \nsources. \n \n This includes 60 Road Projects and 40 Railway Projects for \nproviding first mile / last mile connectivity as given in \nAnnexure. \n \n\n(d) to (e)  The above critical Transport Infrastructure Projects have \nbeen identified as first/last mile connectivity to Ports and \nhence Rajasthan is not included.  \n  \n\nANNEXURE \nANNEXURE REFERRED TO IN REPLY TO PART (a)  TO (c)  OF LOK \nSABHA UNSTARRED QUESTION NO. 916 FOR ANSWER ON 07.12.2023 \nASKED BY SHRIMATI JASKAUR MEENA: REGARDING TRANSPORT \nINFRASTRUCTURE \n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- \n \nList of Critical Infra Gap Projects of MoRTH \nSl \nNo. \n \nState Project Name Port \n1 Gujarat Widening & improvement of existing \n2/4/6 lanes KK ROAD into 6 lane road. \n(NH-141 to NH -8A (Chainage at \n354KM) implemented by NHAI \nKandla \n(Deendayal \nPort) \n2 Kerala Four laning of NH 966 B connecting \nW/Island to Kundanoor  (8 KMs) to be \nimplemented by NHAI \nCochin \n3 Gujarat Construction of 6 -lane link road \nconnecting to KK-Road to NH-8A (NH-\n141 to NH-8A (Chainage at 349.5 KM) \nKandla \n(Deendayal \nPort) \n4 Gujarat Construction of highway from SH-6A to \nJamnagar Port providing connectivity \nto NH from Rajkot \nBedi \n5 Odisha Widening of Chandikhole -Paradip \nNational Highway 53 as an 8 lane \nhighway \nParadip \n6 Karnata\nka \nConstruction of 4 lane flyover bridge \nfrom KIOCL junction to Balkampady \nalong NH-66 \nNew \nMangalore \n7 Karnata\nka \nRoad connectivity to Belekeri Belekeri \n8 Gujarat Road Connectivity to Bhavnagar Port Bhavnagar \n9 Tamil \nNadu \nNew Road over bridge from the \nproposed Goods shed to NH 179A \nJolarpet \n(Chennai) \n10 Tamil \nNadu \n2. Widening of existing narrow lane in \nrailway Iand and widening of \nnatrampalli - Jolarpet 2 lane road to 4 \nlane ro ad \nJolarpet \n(Chennai) \n11 Gujarat Conversion of